    "detailed_description": "Festoon Player\u00a0<br>For 360 media enthusiasts, Fulldome Distributors, Exhibitors and Festival Curators. <br>\u00a0<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playback existing fulldome content in a virtual dome from any video or still image format (PNG,JPG).<br></li><li>Includes four pre-set virtual environments (standard dome, flat dome, cinema, equirectangular).<br></li><li>Playback of Mono, Stereo (Over Under) and Stereo (Side by Side).<br></li><li> Both VR and none VR support provided with anaglyph options for desktop stereo footage.<br></li><li></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Media Support</h2><br><strong>Media Foundation</strong><br>Media Foundation offers good support for most video formats. It comes as standard on both Windows 8 and 10. <br><br><strong>DirectShow</strong><br>If the video format you wish to use isn't support by Media Foundation then Directshow support is also offered allowing you to install any codecs needed for your media.<br><br><strong>Image Support</strong><br>Festoon Player image support includes PNG and JPG formats.",
    "about_the_game": "Festoon Player\u00a0<br>For 360 media enthusiasts, Fulldome Distributors, Exhibitors and Festival Curators. <br>\u00a0<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playback existing fulldome content in a virtual dome from any video or still image format (PNG,JPG).<br></li><li>Includes four pre-set virtual environments (standard dome, flat dome, cinema, equirectangular).<br></li><li>Playback of Mono, Stereo (Over Under) and Stereo (Side by Side).<br></li><li> Both VR and none VR support provided with anaglyph options for desktop stereo footage.<br></li><li></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Media Support</h2><br><strong>Media Foundation</strong><br>Media Foundation offers good support for most video formats. It comes as standard on both Windows 8 and 10. <br><br><strong>DirectShow</strong><br>If the video format you wish to use isn't support by Media Foundation then Directshow support is also offered allowing you to install any codecs needed for your media.<br><br><strong>Image Support</strong><br>Festoon Player image support includes PNG and JPG formats.",
    "short_description": "Watch back your fulldome/360 degree or flat screen media in a virtual environment. Choose from 4 environments including, tilted dome, flat dome, equirectangular and cinema. Full VR and None VR is supported.",
